# 统一行尾：脚本在 macOS runner 上执行，CRLF 会让 bash / python 直接报错。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.ipa   binary
*.dmg   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.otf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.mlmodelc binary
*.car   binary
